"A constant whose value reads mutable data: FX-26 reads it where the
 constant is defined, KFX at its first use, which may be after a write
 (C21); so KFX refuses it."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define cell (ref i64 @c) (new 1))
(define seen i64 (get cell))
(set cell 2)
seen
